        "en": "Dedicated clinicians amidst uneven service"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners appreciate Dr. Gurmani and the late-night team for providing compassionate treatment during distressing veterinary visits. Conversely, several clients report curt communication from front desk personnel and inconsistent bedside demeanor from staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Urgent surgical care beside diagnostic disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews describe effective outcomes for emergency wound repairs, cat abscesses, and urgent medical stabilization after hours. Other pet owners express frustration over contested laboratory assessments, missed bite wounds, and complications following procedures."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Recurring gaps in client communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently point out difficulties getting clear guidance over the telephone or timely updates on laboratory reports. Multiple reviewers cite unanswered messages, abrupt phone interactions, and limited discussions about post-treatment care plans."
      }
    }
